{
  "name": "dsh-cnki-agent",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "description": "CNKIAgent：知网论文检索—精读—评估—写作—去 AIGC 一体化插件。通过 dsh-browser-cdp 驱动本地 Edge 打开真实知网逐词检索，配合核心期刊编辑视角精读、研究版图与选题、分步写作、去 AI 味与语体配平、引用审计、Word 排版（题注/交叉引用/公式编号/三线表/GB/T 7714）与论文插图（架构图/流程图原生矢量生成），并带右侧栏文献库面板。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "skills",
    "assets",
    "locale",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Jerry113245/dsh-cnki-agent.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Jerry113245/dsh-cnki-agent/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Jerry113245/dsh-cnki-agent#readme",
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node scripts/check-imports.mjs && node --check lib/index.js && node --check lib/client.js"
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0-0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cnki",
    "知网",
    "academic",
    "literature-search",
    "paper-writing",
    "de-aigc"
  ]
}
